error[E0082]: module-level 'let' cannot hold '[]i64': only untraced types may live in a per-thread '@threadlocal' cell
 --> module_state_slice.bit:4:18
  |
4 | @threadlocal let buf = []i64(4)
  |                  ^^^ this cell is not scanned by the collector, so it may hold integers, floats, bools, raw '*T' pointers, or fixed arrays of those — but never a reference (§11.11)
